"Configure the color of the external subtitles, alternative (normal in white, italic in yellow, bold in "
"cyan, underscore in green), white or yellow."
msgstr "配置外部字幕的颜色，可选（普通白色，斜体黄色，青色粗体，绿色下划线），白色或黄色。"

msgid "Configure the color of the teletext subtitles."
msgstr "配置图文字幕的颜色。"

msgid "Configure the contrast level of the front panel display."
msgstr "配置前面板显示屏的对比度."

msgid ""
"Configure the cursor behavior in the channel selection list. When opening the channel selection list you "
"can remain on the current service or already select up/down and you are able to revert the B+/B- buttons."
msgstr ""
"在频道选择列表中配置光标行为。 打开频道选择列表时，您可以保留当前的服务或已经选择上/下，您可以还原B + / "
"B-按钮。"

msgid "Configure the duration (in minutes) for the screensaver."
msgstr "配置屏幕保护程序的持续时间（以分钟为单位）。"

