msgstr "配置第一个音频语言（最高优先级）。"

msgid "Configure the first subtitle language (highest priority)."
msgstr "配置第一个字幕语言（最高优先级）。"

msgid "Configure the font size of the subtitles."
msgstr "配置字幕的字体大小。"

msgid ""
"Configure the font size relative to skin size, so 1 increases by 1 point size, and -1 decreases by 1 "
"point size."
msgstr "配置相对于皮肤尺寸的字体大小，因此1增加1点大小，-1减小1点大小。"

msgid "Configure the fourth audio language."
msgstr "配置第四音频语言。"

msgid "Configure the fourth subtitle language."
msgstr "配置第四字幕语言。"

msgid "Configure the function of the <  > buttons."
msgstr "配置功能 <  > 按钮."

