msgstr "配置字幕水平对齐。"

msgid "Configure the infobar fading speed"
msgstr "配置信息栏渐退速度"

msgid ""
"Configure the initial fast forward speed. When you press the fast forward button, winding will start at "
"this speed."
msgstr "配置初始快进速度。按下快进按钮时，绕行将以此速度开始。"

msgid ""
"Configure the initial rewind speed. When you press the rewind button, rewinding will start at this speed."
msgstr "设定初始倒带速度。当你按下倒带按钮时，倒带将以这个速度启动。"

msgid "Configure the latitude of your location."
msgstr "配置位置的纬度。"

msgid "Configure the longitude of your location."
msgstr "配置位置的经度。"

msgid ""
"Configure the minimum amount of disk space to be available for recordings. When the amount of space "
"drops below this value, deleted items will be removed from the trash can."
msgstr "配置可用于录制的最小磁盘空间。当空间量低于这个值时，删除的项目将从垃圾桶中删除。"

msgid ""
"Configure the minimum width before showing the 'i' icon, '0' is equal to not showing the icon at all."
msgstr "在显示“i”图标之前配置最小宽度，“0”等于不显示图标。"

msgid "Configure the nameserver (DNS)."
msgstr "配置域名服务器（DNS）。"

msgid "Configure the netmask."
msgstr "配置网络掩码."

msgid ""
"Configure the number of days after which items are automatically removed from the trash can.\n"
"A setting of 0 disables this."
msgstr ""
"配置从垃圾桶中自动移除项目的天数.\n"
"设置为0将禁用此选项。"

msgid ""
"Configure the number of days old timers are kept before they are automatically removed from the timer "
"list."
msgstr "在自动从计时器列表中删除之前保存旧计时器的天数。"

msgid "Configure the number of days old timers' log details are kept before they're automatically removed."
msgstr "配置在自动删除旧计时器的日志详细信息之前保留的天数。"

msgid "Configure the number of rows shown."
msgstr "配置显示的行数。"

msgid ""
"Configure the offline decoding delay (in milliseconds). The configured delay is observed at each control "
"word parity change."
msgstr "配置脱机解码延迟（以毫秒为单位）。在每个控制字奇偶变化中观察到配置的延迟。"

msgid "Configure the possible fast forward speeds."
msgstr "配置可能的快进速度。"

msgid "Configure the possible rewind speeds."
msgstr "配置可能的倒带速度。"

msgid "Configure the primary EPG language."
msgstr "配置主EPG语言。"

msgid "Configure the refresh rate of the screen. Multi means refresh rate depends on the source 24/50/60Hz"
msgstr "配置屏幕的刷新率。 多意味着刷新率取决于源 24/50/60Hz"

msgid "Configure the second audio language."
msgstr "配置第二音频语言。"

msgid "Configure the second subtitle language."
msgstr "配置第二字幕语言。"

msgid "Configure the secondary EPG language."
msgstr "配置辅助EPG语言。"

msgid "Configure the skip time interval for the 1 and 3 buttons."
msgstr "配置1和3按钮的跳过时移间隔。"

msgid "Configure the skip time interval for the 4 and 6 buttons."
msgstr "配置4和6按钮的跳过时移间隔。"

msgid "Configure the skip time interval for the 7 and 9 buttons."
msgstr "配置7和9按钮的跳过时移间隔。"

msgid "Configure the slow motion speeds."
msgstr "配置慢动作速度。"

