msgid "If enabled the output resolution of the box will try to match the resolution of the video content"
msgstr "如果启用，该框的输出分辨率将尝试匹配视频内容的分辨率"

msgid "If enabled the video will always be de-interlaced."
msgstr "如果启用，视频将始终是隔行扫描。"

msgid "If enabled, a log will be kept of CEC protocol traffic ('hdmicec.log')."
msgstr "如果启用，将保留 CEC 协议流量的日志 （“hdmicec.log”）。"

msgid "If enabled, display shows 12 chars instead 8, but in latin-1/translit only."
msgstr "如果启用，显示屏将显示 12 个字符而不是 8 个字符，但仅显示拉丁语-1/音译。"

msgid "If set to 'Standard' number buttons page up/down/left/right."
msgstr "如果设置为“标准”数字按钮，则向上/向下/向左/向右翻页。"

msgid "If set to 'yes' channels without EPG will not be shown."
msgstr "如果设置为“是”，则不显示没有EPG的频道。"

msgid "If set to 'yes' it will show the 'PO' packages in browser."
msgstr "如果设置为“是”，它将在浏览器中显示“PO”包。"

msgid "If set to 'yes' it will show the 'SRC' packages in browser."
msgstr "如果设置为“是”，它将在浏览器中显示“SRC”包。"

msgid "If set to 'yes' shows a small TV screen in the EPG."
msgstr "如果设置为“是”，则会在 EPG 中显示一个小电视屏幕。"

msgid ""
"If set to 'yes' signal values (SNR, etc) will be calculated from API V3. This is an old API version that "
"has now been superseded."
msgstr "如果设置为“是”，则信号值（SNR 等）将从 API V3 计算。这是一个旧的 API 版本，现已被取代。"

msgid ""
"If set to 'yes' the EPG will always open at the first channel of bouquet. If set to 'no' the EPG will "
"open on the current channel."
msgstr "如果设置为“是”，EPG将始终在第一个用户组频道打开。 如果设置为“否”，EPG将在当前频道上打开。"

msgid "If set to 'yes' the bouquets will be shown each time you open the EPG."
msgstr "如果设置为“是”，每次打开EPG时都会显示用户组。"

msgid "If set to 'yes' the channel list will be shown after switching between radio and TV modes."
msgstr "如果设置为“是”，则在切换广播和电视模式之后将显示频道列表。"

msgid "If set to 'yes' the channel number will be displayed in the infobar."
msgstr "如果设置为“是”，频道号将显示在信息栏中。"

msgid "If set to 'yes' the infobar will be displayed when a new event starts."
msgstr "如果设置为“是”，则在新事件开始时将显示信息栏。"

msgid "If set to 'yes' the infobar will be displayed when changing channels."
msgstr "如果设置为“是”，则在更改频道时将显示信息栏。"

msgid ""
"If set to 'yes' the same commands will be sent to the TV for deep standby events, as are sent during "
"regular standby events."
msgstr "如果设置为“是”，则将向电视发送深度待机事件的相同命令，就像在常规待机事件期间发送的那样。"

msgid "If set to 'yes' you can preview channels in the EPG list."
msgstr "如果设置为“是”，您可以预览EPG列表中的频道。"

msgid ""
"If set to 'yes' you can preview channels in the channel list. Press 'OK' to preview the selected "
"channel, press a 2nd 'OK' to exit and zap to that channel, pressing 'EXIT' to return to the channel you "
"started at."
msgstr ""
"如果设置为“是”，您可以预览频道列表中的频道。 按“确定”预览所选频道，按第二个“确定”退出并切换到该频道，"
"按“退出”返回到您开始播放的频道。"

msgid "If set to 'yes', allows you to use the seekbar to jump to a point within the event."
msgstr "如果设置为“是”，则允许您使用查找栏跳转到事件中的某个点。"

msgid ""
"If set to 'yes', the infobar will be displayed when Fast Forwarding or Rewinding during media playback."
msgstr "如果设置为“是”，则在媒体播放期间快速转发或回放时将显示信息栏。"

msgid "If the text is too long to be displayed on the front panel, it will be repeated (number of times):"
msgstr "如果文本太长，无法显示在前面板上，将会重复（次数）："

msgid ""
"If using multiple uncommitted switches the DiSEqC commands must be sent multiple times. Set to the "
"number of uncommitted switches in the chain minus one."
msgstr "如果使用多个未提交的开关，则必须多次发送 DiSEqC 命令。设置为链中未提交的交换机数减去 1。"

msgid "If volume muted, hide mute icon or mute information after few seconds."
msgstr "如果音量静音，请在几秒钟后隐藏静音图标或静音信息。"

msgid "If you are using a Circular polarised LNB select 'yes', otherwise select 'no'."
msgstr "如果您使用的是圆偏振LNB，请选择“是”，否则选择“否”。"

msgid ""
"If you are using a DiSEqC committed switch enter the port letter required to access the LNB used for "
"this satellite."
msgstr "如果您使用的是 DiSEqC 承诺开关，请输入访问用于此卫星的 LNB 所需的端口号。"

msgid ""
"If you are using a DiSEqC uncommitted switch enter the port number required to access the LNB used for "
"this satellite."
msgstr "如果您使用的是 DiSEqC 未承诺的交换机，请输入访问用于此从属设备的 LNB 所需的端口号。"

msgid ""
"If you are an OpenBh developer you can enter your login details to have direct access to OpenBh "
"developerimages for your receiver.This feature is only available via'https'connections."
msgstr ""
"如果您是OpenBh开发人员，您可以输入您的登录详细信息，以直接访问您的接收者的OpenBh开发人员图像。此功能只能"
"通过“https”连接使用。"

msgid ""
"If you can see this, something is wrong with\n"
"your scart connection. Press OK to return."
msgstr ""
"如果你能看到这一点，那就错了。\n"
"你的SCART连接。按OK返回。"

msgid ""
"If your TV has a brightness or contrast enhancement, disable it. If there is something called \"dynamic"
"\", set it to standard. Adjust the backlight level to a value suiting your taste. Turn down contrast on "
"your TV as much as possible.\n"
"Then turn the brightness setting as low as possible, but make sure that the two lowermost shades of gray "
"stay distinguishable.\n"
"Do not care about the bright shades now. They will be set up in the next step.\n"
"If you are happy with the result, press OK."
msgstr ""
"如果您的电视具有亮度或对比度增强功能，请禁用它。 如果有一些叫做“动态”的东西，请将其设置为标准。 将背光级"
"调整到适合您口味的值。 尽可能降低电视上的对比度.\n"
"然后将亮度设置尽可能低，但请确保两个最低的灰色阴影保持不变。\n"
"不要在乎现在的明亮色调。 他们将在下一步建立.\n"
"如果您对结果感到满意，请按OK。"

msgid ""
"If your usb drive is connected and mounted you must poweroff your box, remove the usb device and "
"reboot.\n"
msgstr "如果 USB 驱动器已连接并安装，则必须关闭机箱电源，取出 USB 设备并重新启动。\n"

