msgid ""
"Select '1.0' for standard committed switches, '1.1' for uncommitted switches, and '1.2' for systems "
"using a positioner."
msgstr ""
"对于标准已提交的交换机，请选择“1.0”，对于未提交的交换机，请选择“1.1”，对于使用定位器的系统，请选择“1.2”。"

msgid ""
"Select 'A' or 'B' if your aerial system requires this, otherwise select 'none'. If you are unsure select "
"'none'."
msgstr "如果天线系统需要,请选择'A'或'B',否则请选择'无'.如果不确定,请选择'无'."

msgid ""
"Select 'FBC SCR' if this tuner will connect to a SCR (Unicable/JESS) device. For all other setups select "
"'FBC automatic'."
msgstr ""
"如果此调谐器将连接到 SCR（Unicable/JESS）设备，请选择“FBC SCR”。对于所有其他设置，请选择“FBC自动”。"

msgid ""
"Select 'Yes' to delete all languages except English and current language:\n"
"\n"
"Select 'No' to delete only the chosen language:\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"选择“是”以删除除英语和当前语言之外的所有语言：\n"
"\n"
"选择“否”以仅删除所选语言：\n"
"\n"

msgid ""
"Select 'Yes' to remove all main settings configuration data. Selecting this option will set all Enigma2 "
"settings back to their default values.  This will also cause Enigma2 to run the Welcome Wizard on "
"restart."
msgstr ""
"选择“是”以删除所有主要设置配置数据。 选择此选项会将所有 Enigma2 设置恢复为默认值。 这也将导致 Enigma2 在"
"重新启动时运行欢迎向导。"

msgid ""
"Select 'Yes' to remove all media player resume data. Selecting this option will remove the data used to "
"allow playback of media files to resume from the position where playback was last stopped. Playback "
"position of recordings is not affected."
msgstr ""
"选择“是”以删除所有媒体播放器恢复数据。 选择此选项将删除用于允许媒体文件从上次停止播放的位置恢复播放的数"
"据。 录音的播放位置不受影响。"

msgid "Select 'Yes' to remove all other files and directories not covered by the options above."
msgstr "选择“是”以删除上述选项未涵盖的所有其他文件和目录。"

msgid ""
"Select 'Yes' to remove all settings, tuning data, timers, resume pointers etc. Selecting this option "
"will restore the configuration to the initial settings before any configuration settings were applied. "
"This is the most reliable form of Factory Reset."
msgstr ""
"选择“是”以删除所有设置、调谐数据、计时器、恢复指针等。选择此选项会将配置恢复到应用任何配置设置之前的初始"
"设置。 这是最可靠的出厂重置形式。"

msgid ""
"Select 'Yes' to remove all timer configuration data. Selecting this option will clear all timers, "
"autotimers and power timers."
msgstr "选择“是”以删除所有计时器配置数据。 选择此选项将清除所有计时器、自动计时器和电源计时器。"

msgid ""
"Select 'Yes' to remove all tuning data. Selecting this option will remove all tuning and bouquet data "
"and will make timers non functional until the receiver is retuned."
msgstr ""
"选择“是”以删除所有调整数据。 选择此选项将删除所有调谐和花束数据，并使计时器无法正常工作，直到接收器重新调"
"谐。"

msgid "Select 'band' if using a 'universal' LNB, otherwise consult your LNB spec sheet."
msgstr "如果使用“通用”LNB，请选择“带”，否则请查阅您的LNB规格表。"

msgid "Select 'enabled' if this tuner has a signal cable connected, otherwise select 'nothing connected'."
msgstr "如果此调谐器连接了信号线，请选择“已启用”，否则选择“未连接”。"

msgid "Select 'polarisation' if using a 'universal' LNB, otherwise consult your LNB spec sheet."
msgstr "如果使用“通用”LNB，请选择“极化”，否则请查阅您的LNB规格表。"

msgid ""
"Select 'provider' to scan from the predefined list of cable multiplexes. Select 'bands' to only scan "
"certain parts of the spectrum. Select 'steps' to scan in steps of a particular frequency bandwidth."
msgstr ""
"从电缆多路复用的预定义列表中选择“提供商”进行扫描. 选择‘波段’仅扫描频谱的某些部分。选择“步骤”至 按特定频率"
"带宽的步进扫描."

msgid ""
"Select 'yes' if this tuner is connected to the SCR device through another tuner, otherwise select 'no'."
msgstr "如果此调谐器通过另一个调谐器连接到 SCR 设备，请选择“是”，否则选择“否”。"

msgid "Select 'yes' to choose what bands or step sizes will be scanned."
msgstr "选择'是'以选择要扫描的波段或步长."

msgid "Select 'yes' to include %s multiplexes in your search."
msgstr "选择“是”以在搜索中包括%s多路复用。"

msgid "Select 'yes' to include symbol rate %s in your search."
msgstr "选择“是”以在搜索中包括符号汇率%s。"

msgid "Select 'yes' to include the %s band in your search."
msgstr "选择“是”以在搜索中包括%s频段。"

msgid ""
"Select 'yes' to only send the DiSEqC command when changing from one satellite to another, or select 'no' "
"for the DiSEqC command to be resent on every zap."
msgstr ""
"选择“是”以在从一个卫星更改为另一个卫星时仅发送 DiSEqC 命令，或选择“否”以在每次 zap 上重新发送 DiSEqC 命"
"令。"

