msgid ""
"Welcome to OpenBlackHole!\n"
"\n"
"NOTE: This section of the wizard is intended for people who cannot disable overscan on their "
"television / display.  Please first try to disable overscan before using this feature.\n"
"\n"
"USAGE: If you continue adjust the screen size and position settings so that the shaded user interface "
"layer *just* covers the test pattern in the background.\n"
"\n"
"Select Yes to change these settings or No to skip this step."
msgstr ""
"欢迎来到开放黑洞！\n"
"\n"
"注意：向导的此部分适用于无法在电视/显示器上禁用过扫描的用户。 在使用此功能之前，请先尝试禁用过扫描。\n"
"\n"
"用法：如果继续调整屏幕大小和位置设置，使带阴影的用户界面层*正*覆盖背景中的测试图案。\n"
"\n"
"选择“是”更改这些设置，或选择“否”跳过此步骤。"

msgid ""
"Welcome to the cutlist editor.\n"
"\n"
"Seek to the start of the stuff you want to cut away. Press OK, select 'start cut'.\n"
"\n"
"Then seek to the end, press OK, select 'end cut'. That's it."
msgstr ""
"欢迎来到剪辑列表编辑器.\n"
"\n"
"寻求你想要消除的东西的开始。 按OK，选择“开始剪切”。\n"
"\n"
"然后寻求到最后，按OK，选择'结束剪切'。 而已。"

msgid ""
"Welcome to the image upgrade wizard. The wizard will assist you in upgrading the firmware of your %s %s "
"by providing a backup facility for your current settings and a short explanation of how to upgrade your "
"firmware."
msgstr ""
"欢迎来到图像升级向导。 该向导将帮助您升级您的 %s %s 固件，为您当前的设置提供一个备份工具，以及如何升级固"
"件的简短说明。"

msgid ""
"Welcome.\n"
