"If you want to connect your %s %s to the Internet, this wizard will guide you through the basic network "
"setup of your %s %s.\n"
"\n"
"Press OK to start configuring your network"
msgstr ""
"欢迎.\n"
"\n"
"如果你想连接你的 %s %s 到互联网，这个向导将引导您完成您的基本网络设置 %s %s.\n"
"\n"
"按OK开始配置网络"

msgid ""
"Welcome.\n"
"\n"
"This start wizard will guide you through the basic setup of your %s %s.\n"
"Press the OK button on your remote control to move to the next step."
msgstr ""
"欢迎.\n"
"\n"
"这个启动向导将引导您完成您的基本设置 %s %s.\n"
"按遥控器上的OK按钮移动到下一步。"

