msgid ""
"When enabled enigma2 will load unlinked userbouquets. This means that userbouquets that are available, "
"but not included in the bouquets.tv or bouquets.radio files, will still be loaded. This allows you for "
"example to keep your own user bouquet while installed settings are upgraded"
msgstr ""
"启用enigma2将加载未链接的用户群。 这意味着仍然可以加载可用但不包含在bouquets.tv或bouquets.radio文件中的用"
"户群。 这样可以让您例如在安装的设置升级时保持自己的用户组"

msgid "When enabled the online checker will also check for experimental versions"
msgstr "启用后，在线检查器还将检查实验版本"

msgid "When enabled the receiver will automatically return to standby when the TV is turned off."
msgstr "启用后，接收器将在电视关闭时自动返回待机状态。"

msgid "When enabled the receiver will automatically wake from standby when the TV is turned on."
msgstr "启用后，接收器将在电视打开时自动从待机中唤醒。"

msgid "When enabled the set top box is able to wakeup on LAN"
msgstr "启用后,机顶盒将可以通过LAN唤醒"

msgid ""
"When enabled, AIT data will be included in http streams. This allows a client receiver to use HbbTV."
msgstr "启用后，AIT数据将被包含在http流中。 这允许客户端接收器使用HbbTV。"

msgid "When enabled, EIT data will be included in http streams. This allows a client receiver to show EPG."
msgstr "启用后，EIT数据将被包含在http流中。 这允许客户端接收器显示EPG。"

msgid "When enabled, a popup message will be shown when a movie has finished and the next one will start."
msgstr "启用后，当电影完成并且下一个将开始时，将显示弹出消息。"

msgid "When enabled, a popup message will be shown when a recording starts."
msgstr "启用时，录制开始时将显示弹出消息。"

msgid "When enabled, a recording is allowed to interrupt live TV, when there are no free tuners."
msgstr "启用后，当没有可用的调谐器时，允许录制中断直播电视。"

msgid ""
"When enabled, a warning will be displayed and the user will get an option to stop or to continue the "
"timeshift."
msgstr "启用时，将显示警告，用户将获得停止或继续时移的选项。"

msgid "When enabled, a warning will be displayed that timeshift is not supported in an IP stream.."
msgstr "启用时，将显示一条警告，即IP流中不支持时移."

msgid ""
"When enabled, always descramble receiving http streams. This takes up more resources (descrambling "
"demuxers), only enable if necessary. Individual streams are always descrambled if 0x100 is added to the "
"service type, regardless of this setting. Default off."
msgstr ""
"启用后，请始终解密接收http流。 这需要更多的资源（解扰分解器），只有在必要时才启用。 无论此设置如何，如果"
"将0x100添加到服务类型，则各个流都将被解扰。 默认关闭。"

msgid "When enabled, authentication is required to watch http streams."
msgstr "启用后，需要进行身份验证才能观看http流。"

msgid "When enabled, channel numbering will start at '1' for every bouquet."
msgstr "启用后，频道编号将从“1”起开始播放用户组。"

msgid "When enabled, content with an aspect ratio of 4:3 will be stretched to fit the screen."
msgstr "启用后，宽高比为4：3的内容将被拉伸以适应屏幕。"

msgid "When enabled, continue to the next bouquet when the last channel of the current bouquet is reached."
msgstr "启用后，当达到当前用户组的最后一个频道时，继续下一个用户组。"

msgid "When enabled, deleted recordings are moved to the trash can, instead of being deleted immediately."
msgstr "启用后，删除的录音将移至垃圾桶，而不是立即删除。"

msgid "When enabled, external subtitles will always be turned on for movie playback."
msgstr "启用后，外部字幕将始终打开以进行动画播放。"

msgid ""
"When enabled, graphical DVB subtitles are preferred over teletext subtitles, when both types are "
"available."
msgstr "启用时，当两种类型都可用时，图形DVB字幕优于图文字幕。"

msgid "When enabled, graphical DVB subtitles will be centered horizontally."
msgstr "启用后，图形化的DVB字幕将以水平方向居中。"

msgid "When enabled, graphical DVB subtitles will be displayed at their original position."
msgstr "启用后，图形DVB字幕将显示在其原始位置。"

msgid "When enabled, graphical DVB subtitles will be displayed in yellow, instead of the original color."
msgstr "启用后，图形DVB字幕将以黄色显示，而不是原始颜色。"

msgid ""
"When enabled, http streams are descrambled on the server side. The (remote) client receiver does not "
"have to do descrambling. Default on."
msgstr "启用后，http流在服务器端进行解扰。 （远程）客户端接收器不必进行解扰。 默认开启。"

msgid "When enabled, it is possible to leave the Movie Player with exit."
msgstr "启用后，可以退出电影播放器。"

msgid ""
"When enabled, measure power consumption to detect when the rotor stops turning (when supported by the "
"tuner)."
msgstr "启用时，测量功率消耗以检测转子何时停止转动（当调谐器支持时）。"

msgid "When enabled, network trash cans are probed for cleaning."
msgstr "启用后，将对网络垃圾桶进行检测以进行清理。"

msgid "When enabled, number markers will be hidden."
msgstr "启用后，数字标记将被隐藏。"

msgid ""
"When enabled, pressing '0' will zap you to the first channel in your first bouquet and delete your zap-"
"history."
msgstr "启用后，按“0”将会切换到第一用户组中的第一个频道，并删除您的切换历史记录。"

msgid "When enabled, reformat subtitles to match the width of the screen."
msgstr "启用后，重新格式化字幕以匹配屏幕的宽度。"

msgid "When enabled, show channel numbers in the channel selection screen."
msgstr "启用后，在频道选择画面中显示频道号。"

msgid "When enabled, subtitles for the hearing impaired can be used."
msgstr "启用后，可以使用听力障碍的字幕。"

msgid ""
"When enabled, subtitles for the hearing impaired will be preferred over normal subtitles, when both "
"types are available."
msgstr "当启用时，当两种类型都可用时，听力受损者的字幕将优于正常字幕。"

msgid "When enabled, teletext pages will be cached, allowing faster access."
msgstr "启用后，图文电视页面将被缓存，允许更快的访问。"

msgid "When enabled, teletext subtitles will be displayed at their original position."
msgstr "当启用时，图文电视字幕将显示在其原始位置。"

msgid "When enabled, the PiP can be closed by the EXIT button."
msgstr "启用后，可通过EXIT按钮关闭画中画。"

msgid "When enabled, the VCR scart option will be shown in the main menu"
msgstr "启用后，VCR scart选项将显示在主菜单中"

msgid ""
"When enabled, the length of each recording will be shown in the movielist (this might cause some "
"additional loading time)."
msgstr "启用后，每个录音的长度将显示在动画影片中（这可能会导致一些额外的加载时间）。"

msgid "When enabled, the receiver will automatically use the audio track which you selected before."
msgstr "启用后，接收机将自动使用您之前选择的音轨。"

msgid "When enabled, the receiver will automatically use the subtitles which you selected before."
msgstr "启用后，接收机将自动使用您之前选择的字幕。"

msgid "When enabled, the receiver will select an AC3 track (when available)."
msgstr "启用后，接收机将选择一个AC3轨道（如果可用）。"

msgid "When enabled, the receiver will select an AC3+ track (when available)."
msgstr "启用后，接收机将选择一个AC3 +轨道（如果可用）。"

msgid "When enabled, this setting has more weight than 'Preferred tuner for recordings'."
msgstr "启用后，此设置比“首选录制调谐器”的权重更大。"

msgid "When enabled, this setting has more weight than 'Preferred tuner'."
msgstr "启用后，此设置的权重高于“首选调谐器”。"

msgid "When enabled, timeshift starts automatically in background after the specified time."
msgstr "启用后，在指定时间后，后台自动启动。"

msgid "When enabled, use DHCP for the IP configuration."
msgstr "启用后，使用DHCP进行IP配置。"

msgid "When enabled, your receiver will detect activity on the VCR SCART input."
msgstr "启用后，您的接收器将检测VCR SCART输入上的活动。"

msgid "When maximum space for all logs is reached, the oldest logs will be deleted."
msgstr "当达到所有日志的最大空间时，最早的日志将被删除。"

msgid "When nonzero, a recording will start earlier than the starting time indicated by the EPG."
msgstr "当非零时，录制将比EPG指示的开始时间早。"

msgid "When nonzero, a recording will stop later than the ending time indicated by the EPG."
msgstr "当非零时，录音将在EPG指示的结束时间之后停止。"

msgid ""
"When receiver wakes from standby, it will command the TV to switch to the HDMI input the receiver is "
"connected to."
msgstr "当接收器从待机状态唤醒时，它会命令电视切换到接收器所连接的 HDMI 输入。"

msgid "When set the PIG will return to live after a movie has stopped playing."
msgstr "如果PIG选择窗口先前观看的频道将被启用后的记录结束。"

msgid ""
"When set to 'user' this option allows you to sort or hide menu items via the blue button in menu "
"screens. When set to 'user defined hidden' the blue button text in the menu remains hidden even though "
"the user sort feature is active."
msgstr ""
"当设置为“用户”时，此选项允许您通过菜单屏幕中的蓝色按钮对菜单项进行排序或隐藏。 当设置为“用户定义隐藏”时，"
"菜单中的蓝色按钮文本保持隐藏，即使用户排序功能处于活动状态。"

msgid ""
"When set, each directory will show the previous state used. When off, the default values will be shown."
msgstr "设置后，每个目录将显示以前使用的状态。关闭时，将显示默认值。"

msgid "When the content has an aspect ratio of 16:9, choose whether to scale/stretch the picture."
msgstr "当内容的宽高比为16：9时，请选择是否缩放/拉伸照片。"

msgid "When the content has an aspect ratio of 4:3, choose whether to scale/stretch the picture."
msgstr "当内容的长宽比为4：3时，选择是否缩放/拉伸照片。"

msgid ""
"When the receiver wakes from standby, it will send a command to the TV to bring it out of standby too."
msgstr "当接收器从待机状态唤醒时，它会向电视发送命令，使其也脱离待机状态。"

msgid ""
"When tuned to a service the system will normally scan the transponder for any changes and save them. "
"Only set to 'yes' if you're absolutely sure of what you're doing."
msgstr ""
"当调整到服务时，系统通常将扫描转发器进行任何更改并保存。 如果你绝对确定你在做什么，那么只能设置为“是”。"

msgid ""
"When you perform a factory reset, you will lose ALL of your configuration data\n"
"(including bouquets, services, satellite data ...)\n"
"After completion of the factory reset, your %s %s will restart automatically!\n"
"\n"
